    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.pick\n\n### Description\n\nIt would be useful to show in the list the save status of the buffer (I didn't find such option with medium amount of searching, if there is such, please point me to right direction and close the ticket).",
    "closed_at": "2025-05-20T09:19:04Z",
